{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act3d0_level_act3d0_07_end",
  "groupId": "act3d0",
  "stageId": "a003_07",
  "title": "Final Stroke",
  "storyCode": "OF-7",
  "avgTag": "After Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/en/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_07_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "783d5b030d05a41216f19aafa0f09278d334d98d4a0931e54de3e8e80a25242c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第六关（后）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herman",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You've been by my side for fifteen years, but you've learned nothing."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Herman",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "All you've managed to pick up are some unsavory tactics. What a dullard you are."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Dullard? Ahaha... Ahahahaha!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Old man, surely you didn't expect me to be out of moves already!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hellagur",
      "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
      "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
      "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
      "text": "What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "This... Could it be the earthquake preceding the eruption?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Ahaha, come! It's finally here!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Turn into ashes along with this city!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "It's too late now! Even if you take control of the broadcast tower, the people will only start panicking!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "The volcano is about to erupt, but what can you possibly accomplish with that 'data' of yours?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "I control all the escape passages! None of you are going to get away!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "You bloody hypocrites can't save anyone!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Cronin",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "Everything will be burnt to nothingness, along with the city!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ceylon",
      "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#8",
      "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
      "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
      "text": "Doctor, what do we do?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Get all the operators to help with the evacuation, now!",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "At least get everyone to where it's safe!",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hellagur",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "Doctor, should we mobilize the entirety of Rhodes Island..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eyjafjalla",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Doctor, can you hear me? I've finished analyzing the volcano!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eyjafjalla",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "If we act now, we can still buy more time!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Provence",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Doctor, we've already determined the underlying cause of the volcano's activity. There's a good possibility that we might be able to stop the eruption!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eyjafjalla",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Everyone, please stay calm and listen closely. If you follow my instructions, we will be able to delay the eruption!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hellagur",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "We can definitely help, if it's really something within our power."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "...Mhm."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "No, please let us handle this."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Cronin has been plotting this for a long time. His henchmen must be all over the city."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "This is the critical moment. Schwarz, Mister Hellagur, you have your own duties."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "We can leave those things to the others..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "But this is our mission."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Ceylon..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Provence",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Agreed."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Provence",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "We're Catastrophe Messengers, volcanologists, and Originium researchers. None of us will just sit and watch while peoples' lives are threatened by something predictable."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Provence",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "What's more, there are people who would use their knowledge to deceive others and line their own pockets. As a Catastrophe Messenger, I can't tolerate seeing people like that!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hellagur",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "I've never seen you get this serious before, but I understand. In any case, Mayor, allow us to aid you with the evacuation."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "...Very well. Schwarz, you should come too."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#3",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "I'm..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Ceylon said she can handle this."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "...Milady, please be careful."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Eyjafjalla",
          "speakerToken": null,
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Have we finished deciding? We don't have much time!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ceylon",
          "speakerToken": "char_348_ceylon_4#3",
          "operatorId": "char_348_ceylon",
          "portraitKey": "char_348_ceylon",
          "text": "Okay! Let's get going right now!"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Schwarz",
          "speakerToken": "char_340_shwaz_2#2",
          "operatorId": "char_340_shwaz",
          "portraitKey": "char_340_shwaz",
          "text": "..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "We should trust her. Besides, what she said was right. We each have our own duty to fulfill."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cronin",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Gahahaha! They're just rushing towards death! Even if they manage to buy an hour or two, so what?!"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cronin",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Your daughter is going to get buried along with most of this city, and you won't even be able to find her body..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Cronin",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_023_2#2",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Guh..."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Hellagur",
          "speakerToken": "char_188_helage_1",
          "operatorId": "char_188_helage",
          "portraitKey": "char_188_helage",
          "text": "Sorry, I couldn't control myself."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Don't worry. He's right about the threat this poses. We can't afford to endanger the citizens any longer."
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Herman",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_024",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Please lend me your assistance."
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
